# Only web/ belongs on Vercel.
#
# Everything else is the desktop assistant, which cannot run in a datacenter and
# has no business being uploaded. main.py and requirements.txt at the repo root
# are also what made Vercel try to build this as a FastAPI service.
*
!web/
!web/**
!vercel.json

# Explicit denials last, so these can never be re-included by the rules above
# no matter how the negations are interpreted. Credentials must not reach a
# static host under any circumstances.
.env
.env.*
config/
mcp_servers.json
uploads/
**/__pycache__/
